msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9F61379E_0202_45A8_9850_9E023C02FA8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You... ⟪k:1⟫What are you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你在说些什么……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_16985783_0C9E_45D6_976E_5508F0AB78BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d61f4d593fcc0d69257ed57d7e87851284dbf901255fbcf00f63d46151ac3e9
#. default-sha256: 4a878d0ec747568f042e8f272dbf3d019c117c4db3698980ee73a967e48fd824
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_16985783_0C9E_45D6_976E_5508F0AB78BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Extinguish your soul?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫消灭……⟪k:1⟫你的灵魂……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6985F51E_3B8F_48EA_99A3_29D4E19BEBA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be04668679e0b012bfcf081c47a12024774a928f21b4cf38f2a0be0a61cbe709
#. default-sha256: e80abeafd4b5db341bc7fe30007ff1197ba9ecaee5988559a09c5c32d844bc67
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6985F51E_3B8F_48EA_99A3_29D4E19BEBA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I want it to be you... ⟪k:1⟫who sends me off.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you grant this girl her "
"selfish request?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是……⟪k:1⟫请你一定要这么做。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫你可以……容许我最后的任性吗？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6998f3b0ee95296ec51c7fa1a29fc94249c08dbfa3c4b8b68237ad2ff7fd19b0
#. default-sha256: 909050a86be1d482fd0079a5b2c90baa38434e87bc2ca0d127895386c4621051
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but because I wanted to set everyone free from the mansion’s cursed bonds..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而是为了……⟪k:1⟫把所有人都从这座被诅咒之馆中解放出来……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0575c1fe364a5f85fda7c481cb99cfd1d8cf9fbf92776d239e964faa853ec00a
#. default-sha256: de8ae5d121d5292fb1e9cf9af93030e0ea41b076814405be69b98f062314112a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And you’re asking me... ⟪k:1⟫to eradicate your soul?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫然而……⟪k:1⟫你却让我消灭你……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f24b37bf3819f4f47944b4edd4c81b173e4f4d9085ffeb403daba8597c77f0af
#. default-sha256: b05d37ee8ef1ada14c7ae810d9e2031488a2c7026317da3526437bfe6cdb4a87
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ be destroyed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我必须在这里被消灭。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫你也……察觉到了吧。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4772abeed6044c16d2c2bf1ee273986de7904a4fdc43bcf8fa861606f549facb
#. default-sha256: 77ed3371797be5b73ef770ec09d527fcf5f9718835a7696bfe6fc1c458454c06
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While it’s true Morgana wished for misfortune to befall them... ⟪k:1⟫if I hadn’t been there, "
"none of their tragedies would have taken place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫复仇的愿望确实是莫尔加娜许下的，⟪k:1⟫但是……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫但如果没有我……⟪k:4⟫悲剧是不会发生的。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83a1c768fe229e4a7ce18b62a4dfd0bc02611d7b659c295ec5461a472570237f
#. default-sha256: 681c8245c801732638b70aa4fc75bba356bc458f07327ae5d51ca6ba7240d2b9
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Culpable?⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫加害者……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4B3A56C_AE7E_4159_A51A_05132BF3EF3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 026fb7bd993b03d7b424cfef43fd5e39896620c72fffe060c68e72352401e523
#. default-sha256: bcbdcebd7b4965b36043cb1a7a309b34a439e4fad0a6315036c3985ceeacabfe
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E4B3A56C_AE7E_4159_A51A_05132BF3EF3F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You didn’t intend for anything bad to befall anyone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你明明……⟪k:1⟫不曾有过一丝恶意……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_C50A9C00_7CD9_4231_9A74_84B933568663
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b159074cf7bca24b6bace9503434ece2fc513d1982943b2176636ba290ec958
#. default-sha256: c8261f2b9903f6315272bf01e1f99041c54fa14ff34b1c06bf06803462aa9a60
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_C50A9C00_7CD9_4231_9A74_84B933568663"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you say we answer one last lingering question, Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……米歇尔……⟪k:1⟫让我们解开最后的谜题吧。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_4CB04B8C_CE64_4467_A3FD_D683F1ABE772
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af97a5e4a8c3fe1e22ebc4ef2b49a52284cd21aaac7623d41a03a49710bb4ec5
#. default-sha256: 68d723a2bc9f48ae43baaf7efdde08c5563c282bcbb0ae7a057811f4f10df148
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4CB04B8C_CE64_4467_A3FD_D683F1ABE772"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The explanation might be a bit lengthy...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but I would like to share it with you "
"before I depart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫说来话长……⟪k:1⟫关于我的存在……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫请让我在最后的时刻，⟪k:4⟫为你一一道来。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_674CEFAD_690E_4D6F_8E66_67076AF5F197
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaba99fb8f61b15b1bb78a50050be88237b14498235dc75515ae9eb74cbb18be
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_674CEFAD_690E_4D6F_8E66_67076AF5F197"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario9:scenario9_E6E37D27_E7E9_4AD8_B0AA_20F76E48BEC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c811f753ca9f30490296818eb75ca7d0cca0e9ed490e6bf9bf37961faa5efe2
#. default-sha256: 98bb302e1ff7f3dbed42901efe65133c1e21ed3dbaa1409468652910e95fdb0c
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E6E37D27_E7E9_4AD8_B0AA_20F76E48BEC2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon her death, Morgana’s soul was afflicted with great pain resulting from the hatred and "
"resentment she bore."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫莫尔加娜临死之际，⟪k:1⟫她的灵魂承受着剧烈的痛苦。⟪k:2⟫这份痛苦，⟪k:3⟫虽来自于她内心的憎恨——"

#: scenario9:scenario9_61E105AB_CBC5_45F8_BB12_D4BBD464AF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b0babbce712fa1f517d239a9f5f5d18cd7daa0e12a90253bec1106cc9412d17
#. default-sha256: dd71f1805bd6ff8ef91e2cb0ec349d63a878a5a5cab50849ff94b86771b813fd
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_61E105AB_CBC5_45F8_BB12_D4BBD464AF7B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A saint must put herself second to all others.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She must be caring, generous, "
"forgiving.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And she must not bear any ill will for anyone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫圣女……必须具有牺牲精神。⟪k:1⟫为他人着想、⟪k:2⟫施与他人恩惠、⟪k:3⟫宽恕他人、⟪k:4⟫绝不能够怀有"
"仇恨之心。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_22806235_A709_4C41_AC81_AD9B75A68C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49e746bf7d0191908027a797d6eaa56da5f0c0e0231a0d0fb92fbf8af1e58e96
#. default-sha256: 28925c364a16e2b4a831c7df8afd2fcc395fef8597dd6aff3fee7cf095e4ee3a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_22806235_A709_4C41_AC81_AD9B75A68C5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So that’s why you always seemed so... ⟪k:1⟫abnormally pure-hearted..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……原来是……⟪k:1⟫这样……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_77EC0F48_FACF_421C_A270_9B439BA11A86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1e5e208ebf80a54aa1f06ca4d2fac2fcd0681d21056b77680cc0c6a1dc84d99
#. default-sha256: 403f6a0f5dcb1497926737b830347c138cd94f75ec56751eb8ec8fa1c0a77e61
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_77EC0F48_FACF_421C_A270_9B439BA11A86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫所以你才……⟪k:1⟫一直……⟪k:2⟫如此纯洁无暇……"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以你才……⟪k:1⟫一直……⟪k:2⟫如此纯洁无暇……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_C7844E63_00A8_4A5C_9E40_77B244818EEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60077d4750c386d97462b0af8d71df1df2f99fa7aba2934cce6fba4f8c8b41fc
#. default-sha256: 328078232394c248f6c648494b0e27dd188df2845d6daa7c363496ff667de008
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_C7844E63_00A8_4A5C_9E40_77B244818EEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I refuse to accept..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就连……⟪k:1⟫想要生存下去的愿望……⟪k:2⟫都不被允许……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_DB5FE44D_E8BF_4FE4_ADC3_359A9861FAAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fdb8f79083ecf75096f51bae0cd3d4e1da2c37bfccf02ea4adb1361bef2c2ef
#. default-sha256: 18d5a050bdd31ac4d33bb0a957318020143086537cdfc876d243b6d62e433de6
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_DB5FE44D_E8BF_4FE4_ADC3_359A9861FAAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was never meant to be a soul of my own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫必须一直待在莫尔加娜的身边——作为她灵魂的一部分待在她身边。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_ED3E19B4_F27A_4DBB_9407_E7BDA4CD3900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 119d29c2537cd5232bc49bdbd2428b25f9ff25ede41b7e1ccb9f11444976e43d
#. default-sha256: 5edc2a1f4d7a14146625e82f665b8b2c902e76d9e9caf0dc7bbf90e023b649da
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_ED3E19B4_F27A_4DBB_9407_E7BDA4CD3900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wished to live,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我的愿望是，⟪k:1⟫存在下去。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_9A5A72F1_0937_45A3_9907_771883651318
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6085c1fcd1ae2e8bb9af3bb564228c04733639f31685c5668f53d010ffed6d82
#. default-sha256: 98c5b4b01010d25879f9ba70757fe317cc976df0b0c9ee59336096911ad82b51
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9A5A72F1_0937_45A3_9907_771883651318"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but your own wish?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而是你的愿望所致吗……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_01EDA556_A383_47E5_9362_9F8E1A0E37F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56725563559b3cd13f7cca2bcf4ab56e826095684d9389f8f5f574d82589a22f
#. default-sha256: d44a3588c1d16416a98ceb337c3af2419e4c966c18dc9db69adf16f522febb50
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_01EDA556_A383_47E5_9362_9F8E1A0E37F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Which meant that my wish... ⟪k:1⟫had the consequence of granting Morgana’s with it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以，⟪k:1⟫我的愿望……⟪k:2⟫也实现了莫尔加娜的愿望。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_EA770485_F763_4E16_90CA_B38FFE952A0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44557bf5c99f50102a34f33cd74bb7178d90877ac7746292dbf0ea9feac97e97
#. default-sha256: 521ff627f115bb6d832a8c28a4e87bd649f5d735fd2269d1b4fd0d2f524022e1
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_EA770485_F763_4E16_90CA_B38FFE952A0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The house, having attained perpetuity, served as a place for those reconstructed by "
"Morgana’s curse to return to."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为了令馆永远存续下去，⟪k:1⟫受到重生诅咒的他们，⟪k:2⟫会再度回到此处……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_BF2BAD37_233B_4AAF_BBA1_1D0845550B0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b55719d0d48278d71bdd229b5fd9e21af7180ccf83ae8736a89afde921bc946
#. default-sha256: 2ae46d2744a02cfe5f77e537fca24f11345254d2055f239b3993a37bf2987ee2
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_BF2BAD37_233B_4AAF_BBA1_1D0845550B0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was the one most affected by her wish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以被她的「愿望」影响最深的——"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D948BE88_0FDF_4E12_B157_FE9A21E42EC8
